    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Deploy Magical Effects Through Enchanted Ammunition</p></blockquote><p>An Arcane Archer studies an elven technique of archery that weaves magic into attacks to produce supernatural effects. Over the centuries, others have learned it and broadened it to ranged weapons of many kinds and to aspects of adventuring outside combat.</p><h3>Arcane Archer Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Jnn3a9SnvL9xzLPJ]{Arcane Archer Lore}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.s7PGDR45iyQknqoS]{Arcane Shot}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.dwfxZHHJwYPu0Eou]{Curving Shot}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.iLdWOw9ooDurUh9N]{Magical Ammunition}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.dRB3C7tYQoBqyydN]{Ever-Ready Shot}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.BOhYR615mNZxuUfB]{Indomitable Teleport}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.CUQVJAuB18UO8q9S]{Masterful Shots}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
